WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840
 With Fable, it was like, I had a second team lead.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:07.360
 And even when he said, and I, he gave me options and I was like, one is gay.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.160
 Two is better.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:09.120
 Three, what is three?

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.080
 Explain it to me.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.080
 And he gave me like a whole new solution to do it even better.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:15.820
 It will, for me, it feels like a proper co-founder, like

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.800
 technical co-founder that level of direction and solution.

